Sun Aug 23 15:05:53 UTC 2026 - Stas Stanila <soyu7658@gmail.com>

- Update to 1.4.0 
 * Added a crash analyzer for Windows programs
 * Added animated and static backgrounds for the detailed view 
 * Added GOG integration
 * Added an "Only Installed" checkbox that works with source filters to hide uninstalled games
 * Added support for displaying .exe icons instead of cover art in the compact detailed view
 * Added the ability to edit Steam shortcuts by AppID
 * Added silent and logging launch modes for .exe files via the "Open with" menu
 * Added actions to game shortcuts for launching in silent mode and with logging enabled
 * Added the `--log` command-line argument to launch the game in logging mode
 * Added interface sounds
 * Added a Steam account selection option in the settings, featuring a default automatic mode and an "All" mode for adding shortcuts for all users.
 * Added safe reading of matugen dark/light palette variants from Dank Material Shell.
 * Added search functionality for MangoHud, vkBasalt, and Gamescope parameters by name and description.
 * Added the ability to install local WINE/Proton archives by dragging and dropping them into the library or version manager.
 * Added a button to open the WINE folder in the version manager.
 * Added a setting to hide control hints.
 * Added a button to delete custom themes.
 * Gamepad handling has been switched from pygame to SDL3, and the pygame dependency has been removed.
 * Update translations
 * Restored the display of native Linux games in the Steam library without showing soundtracks.
 * Fixed PortProtonQt settings buttons being cut off in narrow windows
 * Fixed the removal of the last launch date when deleting a game shortcut
 * Fixed icon extraction for launchers that start the target EXE via an adjacent .bat or .cmd file
 * Fixed interface freezing during RPM package verification before game launch
 * Fixed control tooltips being cut off when wrapping to a second line
 * Fixed interface stuttering while loading the WINE/Proton list and calculating installed version sizes
 * Fixed icon recoloring for the built-in file manager via ICON_COLORS
 * Fixed the application of fade animation duration to the cover image appearance during slide and bounce animations on the details page
 * Fixed the issue where theme parameters for card dimensions, margins, corner radii, and shadows were ignored in grid and list modes
 * Fixed slow preview loading and redundant network requests when scrolling through the theme store
 * Fixed inconsistent D-pad navigation order across game cards
 * System actions in `--ppqtos` mode have been migrated to `systemctl` and `loginctl`
 * Fixed the recoloring of control hint SVG icons via `ICON_COLORS`
 * Fixed Cyrillic input when searching for games
 * Game search is now limited to titles only (no matching against descriptions)
 * Fixed the state of the stop button when switching the details page to compact view
 * Fixed interface freeze after a game finishes
 * Fixed primary Steam account detection using the latest timestamp in `loginusers.vdf`, with fallback to `AutoLogin` or a single `userdata` profile, and `MostRecent` support for compatibility with older Steam versions
 * WINE/Proton extraction no longer changes the application's working directory and rejects paths from the archive that extend outside the installation directory
 
